                                                "sense_id": "f59c99f2-51b7-31e2-aca7-556ff1a51bcd",
                                                "text": "He's a self-satisfied klutz who aspires to be a con artist. . . . Compared with Lawrence, Freddy is small change."
                                            }
                                        ]
